<title>USA: Knape &amp; Vogt Q3 March 31 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Knape &amp; Vogt Q3 March 31 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>GRAND RAPIDS, Mich. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pct</p>
<p>						1997	  1996    Change</p>
<p> Net Sales			 $46,072,548   $44,813,408    2.8%</p>
